      <p class="text-r4">Crazy Frederick bought many very exquisite opal jewels</p>
      <p class="text-r4 font-bold">Crazy Frederick bought many very exquisite opal jewels</p>
      <p class="text-r4 font-italic">Crazy Frederick bought many very exquisite opal jewels</p>
