      <h1>History of the Web</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        The web has evolved from static documents into dynamic, interactive platforms shaping everyday life.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Tim Berners-Lee</strong> proposed the World Wide Web in 1989 as a way to share information across systems.
        Hosted at CERN in 1991, the first website explained the basics of the web, linking to related documents.
      </p>
      <p>
        The 1990s saw explosive growth as businesses flocked online, giving rise to the <code>.com</code> era.
      </p>

      <h5>Web 2.0 and User Content</h5>
      <p>
        Sites like <a href="https://wikipedia.org">Wikipedia</a>, <a href="https://youtube.com">YouTube</a>, and <a href="https://facebook.com">Facebook</a> ushered in the age of user-generated content.
      </p>

      <h5>Text Styles</h5>
      <p>
        Use <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>bold</strong>, <code>code</code>, and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Z</kbd> to represent keyboard input.
      </p>

      <h5>Lists</h5>
      <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
      </ul>
      <ol>
        <li>Plan</li>
        <li>Design</li>
        <li>Deploy</li>
      </ol>

      <dl>
        <dt>HTML</dt>
        <dd>Structure of web pages</dd>
        <dt>CSS</dt>
        <dd>Visual styling</dd>
      </dl>

      <h5>Table</h5>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Tech</th>
            <th>Purpose</th>
            <th>Year</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>HTML</td>
            <td>Page structure</td>
            <td>1991</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>CSS</td>
            <td>Styling</td>
            <td>1996</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>JavaScript</td>
            <td>Interactivity</td>
            <td>1995</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h5>Blockquote / Indent Support</h5>
      <blockquote>
        <p>"Vague but exciting." — <strong>Mike Sendall</strong></p>
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Nested blockquote for indent level 2 -->
      <blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          <p>This represents a second level of indentation.</p>
        </blockquote>
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Outdent would remove one blockquote level -->

      <h5>Conclusion</h5>
      <p>
        The web continues to grow—from a simple document-sharing tool to a foundation for global communication and commerce.
      </p>
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  {% render 'styleguide-card', content: typographic_richtext_elements_content %}

  <h2 id="centering" class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12"><a href="#centering">Baseline ratio centering</a></h2>

  {% capture typography_centering_content %}
    {% assign methods = 'vars-type-center,py-type-center-swap,py-type-center-add,my-type-center-swap,my-type-center-add,ty-type-center' | split: ',' %}
    {% assign caps = 'normal,uppercase' | split: ',' %}
    {% assign sizes = 'r13' | split: ',' %}

    {% assign fonts = 'heading,subheading,accent,body' | split: ',' %}
    {% assign label = '' %}
    {% assign label_class = '' %}
    {% assign quick_brown_fox = '' %}

    <div class="prose">
      <h3> Centering fonts with <code>baseline_ratio</code> and css <code>cap</code> height values. </h3>
      <p> HTML wraps fonts in a content box. When two different fonts are used in a line, the font baseline is used to align them.</p>
      <p> This magic assumes inline positioning. When fonts are displayed inside buttons and badges we lose the magic baseline information.</p>
      <p> We also gain an extra bit of alignment complexity.</p>
      <h6> For most fonts, centering a capitalized letter requires two ratios:</h6>
      <ul>
      <li>Baseline: distance from the bottom of the content box to the baseline</li>
      <li>Cap height: distance from the top of the content box to the top of the capitalized letters</li>
      </ul>

      <h6> Centering a lowercase letter requires a third value:</h6>
      <ul>
      <li>X-height: distance from the top of the content box to the top of a lowercase x</li>
      </ul>

      <h6> Lowercase fonts also have:</h6>
      <ul>
      <li>Ascender: the top of a curve letter like f may protrude above the cap height</li>
      <li>Descender: the bottom of a j or p</li>
      </ul>

      <p> This is why visually centering a font is challenging. The centering is not the same for uppercase and lowercase letters.</p>

      <h6>How it works:</h6>
      <p>To achieve visual centering, we calculate the space above the cap-height and below the baseline, represented below as the colored areas.</p>

      <p>We turn those values into three classes that can be used to center text:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>One that only calculates the vars and lets you decide how to center the text</li>
      <li>Two that trim them from the line height, and apply them as margin or padding but flipped so the text is perfectly centered when capitalized and optically near-centered when lowercase containing capital letters</li>
      </ul>

      <p>The reason this is not done everywhere is because it's not an improvement over baseline centering, and only works perfectly in cases where the font is uppercase. It works very well in buttons and badges, but will not improve the rhythm of prose text.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="w-full overflow-x-auto">

      {% for method in methods %}
        <h2 class="type-kicker my-r6">Centering: <code class="p-r2 bg-content/10">{{ method | capitalize }}</code></h2>
        <p class="whitespace-nowrap relative flex-row-center flex-nowrap gap-r2">
          {% for size in sizes %}
            {% for capitalization in caps %}
              {% for font_family in fonts %}

                {% capture label_class %}
                  font-family-{{font_family}}
                  text-{{size}}
                  type-case-{{ capitalization }}
                  {{method}}
                  type-apply
                {% endcapture %}

                {% capture g_class %}
                  inline-block
                  absolute
                  left-0
                  right-0
                  border-y border-dashed border-canvas/30 bg-primary/20
                {% endcapture %}

                {% if method contains 'swap' %}
                  {% assign start = 'end' %}
                  {% assign end = 'start' %}
                {% else %}
                  {% assign start = 'start' %}
                  {% assign end = 'end' %}
                {% endif %}

                <span class="bg-content/10 flex">
                  <span class="{{ label_class }} bg-content/10 relative">

                    {{ font_family | capitalize }} {{ quick_brown_fox }}

                    <!-- Baseline trim -->
                    <span class="{{ g_class }} bg-primary/10" style="height: var(--baseline-space); inset-block-{{end}}: 0;"></span>
                    <!-- Cap trim -->
                    <span class="{{ g_class }} bg-secondary/10" style="height: var(--cap-space); inset-block-{{start}}: 0;"></span>

                  </span>
                </span>

              {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
          {% endfor %}
        </p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  {% render 'styleguide-card', content: typography_centering_content %}

  <hr class="border-1 my-r10 border-line-bold">

  <h2 id="form-elements" class="type-h2 mb-r7 text-r9"><a href="#form-elements">Form Elements</a></h2>
  {% capture form_elements_content %}
    <h2 class="py-r5 text-r8 font-bold">{{ label }}</h2>

    <h3 id="text-input-fields" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#text-input-fields">Text input fields</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% assign sizes = "sm,md,lg" | split: "," %}
        {% for size in sizes %}
          {% case size %}
            {% when 'sm' %}
              {% assign label = 'Small' %}
            {% when 'md' %}
              {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
            {% when 'lg' %}
              {% assign label = 'Large' %}
          {% endcase %}

          {% assign name = 'input-' | append: '-' | append: size %}
          {% render 'field-input', placeholder: 'e.g. test@test.com', label: label, size: size, type: 'email', name: name %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% render 'field-input', label: "Disabled", disabled: true %}
        {% render 'field-input', label: "w/ value", value: 'test@test.com', type: 'email', name: 'email', class: 'max-w-[200px]' %}
        {% render 'field-input', label: "w/o label", class: 'max-w-[200px]', hide_label: true %}
        {% render 'field-input', label: "w/ error", class: 'max-w-[200px]', value: 'Some Value', error_message: 'Error!' %}
        {% render 'field-input', label: "w/ success", class: 'max-w-[200px]', value: 'Some Value', success_message: 'Success!' %}
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% assign sizes = "sm,md,lg" | split: "," %}
        {% for size in sizes %}
          {% case size %}
            {% when 'sm' %}
              {% assign label = 'Small' %}
            {% when 'md' %}
              {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
            {% when 'lg' %}
              {% assign label = 'Large' %}
          {% endcase %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 id="textarea-fields" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#textarea-fields">Textarea Fields</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% assign sizes = "sm,md,lg" | split: "," %}
        {% for size in sizes %}
          {% case size %}
            {% when 'sm' %}
              {% assign label = 'Small' %}
            {% when 'md' %}
              {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
            {% when 'lg' %}
              {% assign label = 'Large' %}
          {% endcase %}
          {% assign name = 'textarea-' | append: '-' | append: size %}
          {% render 'field-textarea', placeholder: 'Enter your message here', label: label, name: name, size: size %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5">
        {% render 'field-textarea', label: "Textarea Input w/ Value", name: "textarea-with-value", value: "Why hello there", size: 'md', class: 'max-w-[200px]' %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 id="range-fields" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#range-fields">Range Fields</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
      {% comment %} {% assign sizes = "sm,md,lg,xl" | split: "," %} {% endcomment %}
      {% assign sizes = "md" | split: "," %}
      {% for size in sizes %}
        {% case size %}
          {% when 'sm' %}
            {% assign label = 'Small' %}
          {% when 'md' %}
            {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
          {% when 'lg' %}
            {% assign label = 'Large' %}
        {% endcase %}
        {% render 'field-range', label: label, size: size, prefix: '$' %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h3 id="stepper-fields" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#stepper-fields">Stepper Fields</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
      {% assign sizes = "sm,md,lg" | split: "," %}
      {% for size in sizes %}
        {% case size %}
          {% when 'sm' %}
            {% assign label = 'Small' %}
          {% when 'md' %}
            {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
          {% when 'lg' %}
            {% assign label = 'Large' %}
        {% endcase %}
        {% render 'field-stepper', label: label, size: size %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h3 id="select-fields" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#select-fields">Select Fields</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% capture select_options %}
          <option value="0">First</option>
          <option value="1">Second</option>
          <option value="2">Third</option>
        {% endcapture %}

        {% assign sizes = "xs,sm,md,lg,xl" | split: "," %}
        {% for size in sizes %}
          {% case size %}
            {% when 'xs' %}
              {% assign label = 'X-Small' %}
            {% when 'sm' %}
              {% assign label = 'Small' %}
            {% when 'md' %}
              {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
            {% when 'lg' %}
              {% assign label = 'Large' %}
            {% when 'xl' %}
              {% assign label = 'X-Large' %}
          {% endcase %}
          {% render 'field-select', label: label, name: 'select', options: select_options, size: size %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% render 'field-select', label: "Disabled Select", name: 'disabled-select', options: select_options, disabled: true, size: 'md' %}

        {% capture checked_select_options %}
          <option value="0">First</option>
          <option value="1" selected>Second</option>
          <option value="2">Third</option>
        {% endcapture %}

        {% render 'field-select', label: "Select w/ value", value: '1', options: checked_select_options %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 id="custom-select-fields" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#custom-select-fields">Custom Select Fields</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% capture custom_select_options %}
          {% render 'custom-select-option', label: "First", value: 1 %}
          {% render 'custom-select-option', label: "Second", value: 2 %}
          {% render 'custom-select-option', label: "Third", value: 3 %}
        {% endcapture %}
        {% assign sizes = "xs,sm,md,lg,xl" | split: "," %}
        {% for size in sizes %}
          {% case size %}
            {% when 'xs' %}
              {% assign label = 'X-Small' %}
            {% when 'sm' %}
              {% assign label = 'Small' %}
            {% when 'md' %}
              {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
            {% when 'lg' %}
              {% assign label = 'Large' %}
            {% when 'xl' %}
              {% assign label = 'X-Large' %}
          {% endcase %}
          {% render 'field-custom-select', name: 'custom-select', size: size, options: custom_select_options, label: label %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% render 'field-custom-select', label: 'Disabled', name: 'disabled-select', options: custom_select_options, disabled: true %}
        {% render 'field-custom-select', label: 'w/ value', name: 'with-value-select', options: custom_select_options, disabled: disabled, value: 2 %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 id="custom-select" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#custom-select">Custom Select</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% capture custom_select_options %}
          {% render 'custom-select-option', label: "First", value: 1 %}
          {% render 'custom-select-option', label: "Second", value: 2 %}
          {% render 'custom-select-option', label: "Third", value: 3 %}
        {% endcapture %}
        {% assign sizes = "xs,sm,md,lg,xl" | split: "," %}
        {% for size in sizes %}
          {% case size %}
            {% when 'xs' %}
              {% assign label = 'X-Small' %}
            {% when 'sm' %}
              {% assign label = 'Small' %}
            {% when 'md' %}
              {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
            {% when 'lg' %}
              {% assign label = 'Large' %}
            {% when 'xl' %}
              {% assign label = 'X-Large' %}
          {% endcase %}
          {% render 'custom-select', name: 'custom-select', size: size, options: custom_select_options, label: label %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-x-r4 md:flex-row">
        {% render 'custom-select', label: 'Disabled', name: 'disabled-select', options: custom_select_options, disabled: true %}
        {% render 'custom-select', label: 'w/ value', name: 'with-value-select', options: custom_select_options, disabled: disabled, value: 2 %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 id="radio-fields-checkboxes" class="py-r5 text-r6 font-bold"><a href="#radio-fields-checkboxes">Radio Fields / Checkboxes</a></h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r2">
      {% render 'field-radio', name: 'radio', value: '1', label: 'Option' %}
      {% render 'field-radio', name: 'radio', value: '2', label: 'Disabled Option', disabled: true %}
      {% render 'field-radio', name: 'radio', value: '3', label: 'Checked Option', checked: true %}
      {% render 'field-checkbox', name: 'checkbox', label: 'Option' %}
      {% render 'field-checkbox', name: 'checkbox-disabled', label: 'Disabled Option', disabled: true %}
      {% render 'field-checkbox', name: 'checkbox-checked', label: 'Checked Option', checked: true %}
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  {% render 'styleguide-card', content: form_elements_content %}

  <h2 id="buttons" class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12"><a href="#buttons">Buttons</a></h2>

  {% capture button_content %}
    {% assign colors = "primary,secondary,black,white,canvas,content" | split: "," %}
    {% assign sizes = "xs,sm,md,lg" | split: "," %}
    {% assign appearance_array = "solid,outline,soft" | split: "," %}

    {% for color in colors %}
      <h3 class="text-r6 text-stain-contrast font-bold">{{ color | capitalize }}</h3>
      <div class="flex flex-row flex-wrap gap-r4">
        <div class="flex-row-center gap-r2">
          {% for size in sizes %}
            {% case size %}
              {% when 'xs' %}
                {% assign label = 'X-Small' %}
              {% when 'sm' %}
                {% assign label = 'Small' %}
              {% when 'md' %}
                {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
              {% when 'lg' %}
                {% assign label = 'Large' %}
            {% endcase %}
            {% render 'core-button', label: label, color: color, appearance: 'solid', sizing: size %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="flex-row-center gap-r2">
          {% for appearance in appearance_array %}
            {% assign label = appearance | capitalize %}
            {% render 'core-button', label: label, color: color, appearance: appearance, sizing: 'md' %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  {% endcapture %}

  {% capture all_buttons %}
    <div class="vars-stain-white bg-stain bg-transparent">
      {{ button_content }}
    </div>
    <div class="vars-stain-black bg-stain p-r6">
      {{ button_content }}
    </div>
    <div class="vars-stain-white bg-stain p-r6" style="background-image: url('{{ section.settings.background_image | image_url }}'); background-size: cover;">
      {{ button_content }}
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  {% render 'styleguide-card', content: all_buttons %}

  <h2 id="links" class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12"><a href="#links">Links</a></h2>

  {% capture link_content %}
    {% assign colors = "primary,secondary,black,white,canvas,content" | split: "," %}
    {% assign sizes = "xs,sm,md,lg,auto" | split: "," %}
    {% assign appearance_array = "clean,line,icon,both,bare" | split: "," %}

    {% for color in colors %}
      <h3 class="text-r6 font-bold">{{ color | capitalize }}</h3>
      <div
        class="
          flex flex-row flex-wrap
          {% if color == 'white' %}
            bg-white-contrast/20
          {% endif %}
          {% if color == 'canvas' %}
            bg-content/20
          {% endif %}
        "
      >
        <div class="flex-row-center gap-r2">
          {% for size in sizes %}
            {% case size %}
              {% when 'xs' %}
                {% assign label = 'X-Small' %}
              {% when 'sm' %}
                {% assign label = 'Small' %}
              {% when 'md' %}
                {% assign label = 'Medium' %}
              {% when 'lg' %}
                {% assign label = 'Large' %}
              {% when 'xl' %}
                {% assign label = 'X-Large' %}
            {% endcase %}
            {% render 'core-link', text: label, color: color, appearance: 'clean', type_resize: size %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="flex-row-center gap-r2 p-r4">
          {% render 'core-link', text: "Custom icon Left", appearance: 'icon', color: color, start_icon: 'fill-reset' %}
          {% render 'core-link', text: "Custom icon Right", appearance: 'icon', color: color, end_icon: 'fill-reset' %}
          {% render 'core-link', text: "Custom icon on both sides", appearance: 'icon', color: color, start_icon: 'fill-reset', end_icon: 'fill-globe' %}
        </div>
        <div class="flex-row-center gap-r2 p-r4">
          {% for appearance in appearance_array %}
            {% assign label = appearance | capitalize %}
            {% render 'core-link', text: label, color: color, appearance: appearance, size: 'md' %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <h3 class="text-r6 font-bold">Inline</h3>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The first
        {% render 'core-link', text: 'website', type_preset: 'p', appearance: 'line' %}
        was simple, a far cry from the
        {% render 'core-link', text: 'interactive', type_preset: 'p', appearance: 'both' %}
        , media-rich sites we encounter today. It provided basic information and links to further resources.
      </p>
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  {% render 'styleguide-card', content: link_content %}

  <h2 id="converted-icons" class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12"><a href="#converted-icons">Converted Icons</a></h2>

  {%- assign icon_types = 'Stroke, Fill' | split: ', ' -%}
  {% for type in icon_types %}
    {%- assign label = type | append: ' Icons' -%}
    {%- case type -%}
      {%- when 'Stroke' -%}
        {%- assign icon_list = 'stroke-arrow-left, stroke-arrow-right, stroke-arrow-up-right, stroke-bare-check, stroke-bare-minus, stroke-bare-plus, stroke-bare-x, stroke-chevron-down, stroke-chevron-left, stroke-chevron-right, stroke-chevron-up, stroke-dots-vertical, stroke-enter-keyboard, stroke-enter-right-long, stroke-header-bag, stroke-header-basket, stroke-header-cart, stroke-header-hamburger-even, stroke-header-hamburger-uneven, stroke-header-search, stroke-header-user, stroke-loader' -%}
      {%- when 'Fill' -%}
        {%- assign icon_list = 'fill-3d-model, fill-3d-model-square, fill-add-bag, fill-add-basket, fill-add-cart, fill-art-clothing-fabric-breathable, fill-art-clothing-fabric-hang, fill-art-clothing-fabric-wash, fill-art-clothing-iron, fill-art-clothing-ruler, fill-art-clothing-shoes, fill-art-clothing-stitch, fill-art-clothing-thread, fill-art-clothing-washer, fill-art-commerce-award, fill-art-commerce-award-wreath, fill-art-commerce-basket-return, fill-art-commerce-cart-check, fill-art-commerce-check-badge, fill-art-commerce-lock-shield, fill-art-commerce-rating, fill-art-commerce-sale, fill-art-commerce-star-rating, fill-art-contact-chat, fill-art-contact-email, fill-art-contact-legal, fill-art-contact-phone, fill-art-contact-send, fill-art-contact-support-headphones, fill-art-delivery-shipment, fill-art-delivery-shipment-world, fill-art-delivery-shipping-eco, fill-art-delivery-shipping-fragile, fill-art-delivery-store, fill-art-delivery-truck, fill-art-food-allergy-dairy, fill-art-food-allergy-fish, fill-art-food-allergy-gluten, fill-art-food-allergy-nuts, fill-art-food-allergy-shellfish, fill-art-food-food-grapes, fill-art-food-food-wine, fill-art-nature-animal, fill-art-nature-animal-paw, fill-art-nature-animal-paw-raised, fill-art-nature-earth, fill-art-nature-leaf, fill-art-nature-recycled, fill-art-nature-water, fill-art-weather-cloud-and-rain, fill-art-weather-cloud-and-wind, fill-art-weather-season-summer, fill-art-weather-season-winter, fill-art-weather-snowflake, fill-art-weather-sun, fill-art-weather-sun-and-waves, fill-art-weather-sun-full, fill-art-weather-sun-partial, fill-art-weather-thermometer, fill-art-weather-waves, fill-art-weather-wind, fill-art-weather-wind-alt, fill-article, fill-camera, fill-cart-success, fill-chat, fill-check, fill-check-small, fill-circle-alert, fill-circle-check, fill-circle-info, fill-circle-x, fill-controls-mute, fill-controls-pause, fill-controls-play, fill-controls-unmute, fill-copy, fill-copy-check, fill-corners-out, fill-edit, fill-file, fill-filter, fill-globe, fill-grid-1, fill-grid-2, fill-grid-3, fill-grid-4, fill-grid-list, fill-link-generic, fill-location, fill-location-check, fill-location-x, fill-logout, fill-magnify, fill-media-video, fill-page, fill-photo, fill-play-circle, fill-reset, fill-ruler, fill-select, fill-share-android, fill-share-ios, fill-social-facebook, fill-social-instagram, fill-social-linkedin, fill-social-medium, fill-social-pinterest, fill-social-rss, fill-social-snapchat, fill-social-tiktok, fill-social-tumblr, fill-social-vimeo, fill-social-x, fill-social-youtube, fill-sort, fill-star, fill-tag, fill-text, fill-trash, fill-user-photo, fill-x-lg, fill-x-md, fill-x-sm, fill-x-xs' -%}
    {%- endcase -%}
    {%- assign icon_arr = icon_list | strip | split: ',' -%}
    {% capture icon_grid_markup %}

    <div x-data="{
      cartColor: '#cccccc',
      iconWidth: 24
    }"
    x-bind:style="`--color-cart-indicator: ${cartColor}; --my-container-width: ${iconWidth}px;`">

      <div class="flex gap-r4 mb-r4">
        <div>
          <label for="cart-color" class="block text-r3 mb-r2">Cart Indicator Color:</label>
          <input
            type="color"
            id="cart-color"
            x-model="cartColor"
            class="w-r8 h-r8 border border-gray-300 rounded cursor-pointer">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="icon-size" class="block text-r3 mb-r2">Icon Size: <span x-text="iconWidth"></span>px</label>
          <input
            type="range"
            id="icon-size"
            x-model.number="iconWidth"
            min="8"
            max="100"
            step="2"
            class="w-full">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-r6 py-r7">

        {% for icon in icon_arr %}
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-r5 bg-content/5 min-w-r12 rounded gap-r4 p-r4 justify-between">
            <div class="flex flex-center" style="font-size:var(--my-container-width);width:var(--my-container-width);height:var(--my-container-width);">
              {% render 'core-icon', icon: icon %}
            </div>
            <div class="text-r1 type-kicker text-center text-muted">
              {{ icon }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endcapture %}

    {% render 'styleguide-card', label: label, content: icon_grid_markup %}

  {% endfor %}

  <h2 id="colors" class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12"><a href="#colors">Colors</a></h2>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-r4 md:grid-cols-3">
    {% for scheme in settings.color_scheme_group %}
      {% assign label = scheme.id %}

      {% capture content %}
        <div class="vars-{{ scheme.id }} bg-canvas text-content p-r8 mb-r6">
          {% render 'core-text-preset',
            text: 'Accent Title',
            class: 'inline-richtext',
            default_type_preset: 'kicker'
          %}
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5 prose">
            <h4 class="text-content">
              Main title
            </h4>
            <h2 class="text-muted">
              Limit title
            </h2>
            <p>
              <span class="text-muted">Text muted</span> & <span class="text-muted-subtle">Text muted-subtle</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet with <span class="text-secondary underline">link color</span> for contrast.
            </p>
            <div class="flex gap-r8 mt-r9">
              {% render 'core-button', type: 'submit', sizing: 'xs', appearance: 'solid', color: 'primary', label: 'Primary Button' %}
              {% render 'core-link', text: 'Text link' %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vars-{{ scheme.id }} flex flex-col divide-y divide-line-bold bg-canvas text-content p-r6 rounded">
          {% render 'styleguide-card-color-scheme-color', name: "canvas", contrast_name: "content" %}
          {% render 'styleguide-card-color-scheme-color', name: "content", contrast_name: "canvas" %}
          {% render 'styleguide-card-color-scheme-color', name: "secondary", contrast_name: "canvas" %}
          {% render 'styleguide-card-color-scheme-color', name: "muted", contrast_name: "canvas" %}
          {% render 'styleguide-card-color-scheme-color', name: "sale", contrast_name: "canvas" %}
          {% render 'styleguide-card-color-scheme-color', name: "primary", contrast_name: "primary-contrast" %}

          <div class="flex flex-row gap-x-r2">
            <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 gap-y-r2 my-r9">
              <p class="mt-r5 text-r1 font-bold text-muted">line-subtle</p>
              <hr class="border-1 border-line-subtle">
              <p class="mt-r5 text-r1 font-bold text-muted">line</p>
              <hr class="border-1">
              <p class="mt-r5 text-r1 font-bold text-muted">line-bold</p>
              <hr class="border-1 border-line-bold">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endcapture %}

      {% render 'styleguide-card', label: label, content: content %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <h2 id="swatches" class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12"><a href="#swatches">Swatches</a></h2>

  {% capture swatch_content %}
    <div class="flex flex-row gap-x-r2">
      {% render 'swatch', color: '#b41e1e', shape: 'circle' %}
      {% render 'swatch', color: '#b41e1e', shape: 'circle', selected: true %}
      {% render 'swatch', color: '#b41e1e', shape: 'square' %}
      {% render 'swatch', color: '#b41e1e', shape: 'square', selected: true %}
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  {% render 'styleguide-card', content: swatch_content %}

  {% for block in section.blocks %}
    {% case block.type %}
      {% when 'cards' %}
        {% capture card_attributes %}
          style="background-image: url('{{ section.settings.background_image | image_url }}'); background-size: cover;"
        {% endcapture %}

        <h3 class="type-h2 mb-r7 mt-r12">Cards</h3>

        {% for type in (1..3) %}
          {% capture card_type %}{% cycle 'product', 'collection', 'article' %}{% endcapture %}

          <div class="mb-r10">
            {% capture card_content %}
              <div class="relative grid grid-cols-4 gap-r6 items-start">
                {% for size in (1..4) %}
                  {% capture card_size %}{% cycle 'lg', 'md', 'sm', 'xs' %}{% endcapture %}

                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-r5">
                    <h3 class="text-r4 font-bold text-muted">{{ card_size | upcase }}</h3>

                    {% case card_type %}
                      {% when 'product' %}
                        {% render 'card-product', product: block.settings.product, size: card_size, button: true %}
                      {% when 'collection' %}
                        {% render 'card-collection', collection: block.settings.collection, size: card_size %}
                      {% when 'article' %}
                        {% render 'card-article', article: block.settings.article, size: card_size, show_author: true, show_tags: true, show_date: true, show_preview: true, show_link: true %}
                    {% endcase %}
                  </div>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            {% endcapture %}

            {% render 'styleguide-card', label: card_type, content: card_content, attributes: card_attributes %}
          </div>
        {% endfor %}

    {% endcase %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endcapture %}

{% render 'core-section', _settings: section.settings, content: content %}

{% schema %}
{
	"name": "Styleguide",
	"settings": [
		{
			"type": "header",
			"content": "Styleguide"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": "Use this to configure global settings"
		},
		{
			"type": "color_scheme",
			"id": "color_scheme",
			"label": "Color scheme"
		},
		{
			"type": "image_picker",
			"id": "background_image",
			"label": "Background image"
		},
		{
			"type": "select",
			"id": "content_width",
			"label": "Content width",
			"default": "page",
			"options": [
				{
					"value": "full",
					"label": "Full"
				},
				{
					"value": "page",
					"label": "Page"
				},
				{
					"value": "custom",
					"label": "⋯"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "range",
			"id": "content_width_custom",
			"label": "Desktop width",
			"visible_if": "{{ section.settings.content_width == 'custom' }}",
			"min": 25,
			"max": 100,
			"step": 5,
			"default": 65,
			"unit": "%"
		},
		{
			"type": "range",
			"id": "content_width_custom_mobile",
			"label": "Mobile width",
			"visible_if": "{{ section.settings.content_width == 'custom'  }}",
			"min": 25,
			"max": 100,
			"step": 5,
			"default": 100,
			"unit": "%"
		},
	],
	"blocks": [
		{
			"type": "cards",
			"name": "Cards",
			"settings": [
				{
					"type": "product",
					"id": "product",
					"label": "Product"
				},
				{
					"type": "collection",
					"id": "collection",
					"label": "Collection"
				},
				{
					"type": "article",
					"id": "article",
					"label": "Article"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
{% endschema %}
